hadiths[167]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1671","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na lambe zahir the aur na past qad, aur na nihayat safed pheeke rang wale aur na gandumi, aur na sakht ghungryale aur na seedhe baalon wale, Allah ne Aap ko chalis saal ki umr par bheja aur Aap Makka mein das saal thehre aur Madina mein das saal, aur Allah Azza wa Jal ne Aap ko saath saal ki umr par wafat di jabke Aap ke sar aur dadhi mein bees safed baal na they (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)."
"1672","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine aaj raat khwab mein Kaaba ke paas dekha to gandumi mard ko dekha jo tum gandumi mardon mein sab se hasin dekhte ho, us ki zulfein jo tum zulfon mein sab se hasin dekhte ho, us ne inhein kanghi ki hai aur wo pani tapka rahi hain, do mardon par tek lagaye hue ya do mardon ke kandhon par, Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha hai, to maine pucha ke ye kaun hai. Kaha gaya ke ye Maseeh Isa hain, phir main achanak ghungryale sakht baalon wale mard ke paas tha jo daein aankh se kana tha goya wo ubhri hui angoor hai, to maine pucha ke ye kaun hai. To mujh se kaha gaya ke ye Maseeh Dajjal hai."
"1673","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maqbari Saeed ke bete Abi Saeed se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke fitrat se paanch hain, nakhun kaatna aur muchhein qatarna aur baghlon ke baal ukhadna aur zer-e-naaf mundwana aur khatna."
"1674","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ibrahim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sab se pehle mehmaan ki mezbani karne wale aur sab se pehle khatna karne wale aur sab se pehle muchhein qatarne wale aur sab se pehle safed baal dekhne wale they, to unhon ne kaha ke aye Rab ye kya hai. To Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke waqar hai aye Ibrahim. To unhon ne kaha ke aye Rab mujhe waqar zyada de. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke muchhon mein se liya jae yahan tak ke hont ka kinara zahir ho aur ye itar hai, aur use jad se na kaate ke apne aap ko musla kare."
"1675","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abi Zubair se, unhon ne Salmi Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke mard baein haath se khae ya aik jooti mein chale aur samma ko lapete aur aik kapde mein ghutne khade kare jabke us ki sharmgah se parda utha ho."
"1676","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi khae to daein haath se khae aur daein haath se piye kyunke shaitan baein haath se khata hai aur baein haath se pita hai."
"1677","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke miskeen ye phirne wala nahi jo logon par phirta hai aur use aik luqma aur do luqme aur aik khajoor aur do khajoorein lautati hain. Unhon ne kaha ke miskeen kaun hai ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke jo ghina na pae jo use ghani kare aur log us ke liye hoshiyar na hon aur us par sadqa karein aur na khada ho aur logon se mange."
"1678","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Bajid Ansari phir Harisi ke bete Ibn Bajid se, unhon ne apni dadi se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke miskeen ko lautao agarche jala hua khur ho."
"1679","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman aik aant mein khata hai aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai."
"1680","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kafir mehmaan aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ke liye bakri ka hukm diya aur wo dohi gayi aur us ka doodh piya phir dusri to use piya phir dusri to use piya yahan tak ke saat bakriyon ka doodh piya, phir wo subah musalman ho gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ke liye bakri ka hukm diya aur wo dohi gayi aur us ka doodh piya phir us ke liye dusri ka hukm diya aur use mukammal na kar saka, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin aik aant mein pita hai aur kafir saat aanton mein pita hai."
"1681","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Khattab ke bete Umar ke bete Abdullah ke bete Zaid se, unhon ne Siddiq ke bete Abi Bakr ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo chandi ke bartanon mein pita hai wo to apne pet mein Jahannam ki aag gar-garata hai."
"1682","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Habib ke bete Ayyub se, unhon ne Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Saad ke azad karda Muthanna ke bete Abi Muthanna Jahni se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Hakam ke bete Marwan ke paas tha to un ke paas Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed dakhil hue to Hakam ke bete Marwan ne us se kaha ke kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke unhon ne sharbat mein phoonkne se mana kya hai. To Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ne us se kaha ke haan. To mard ne us se kaha ke ya Rasulullah main aik saans se serab nahi hota. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke pyala apne munh se hatao phir saans lo. Unhon ne kaha ke main is mein tinkaa dekhta hun. Aap ne farmaya ke use baha do."
"1683","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Umar bin Khattab aur Talib ke bete Ali bin Abi Talib aur Affan ke bete Usman khade hokar pite they."
"1684","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Momineen ki maan Aaisha aur Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Saad insan ke khade hokar peene mein koi harj na samajhte they."
"1685","Mujhe Malik ne Qari ke bete Abi Jafar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko khade hokar pite dekha."
"1686","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abdullah ke bete Aamir se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo khade hokar pite they."
"1687","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kunwein ke pani se mila doodh laya gaya jabke Aap ke daein dehati tha aur Aap ke baein Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr they, to Aap ne piya phir dehati ko diya aur farmaya ke daein phir daein."
"1688","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abi Hazim se, unhon ne Ansari Saad ke bete Sahl se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas sharbat laya gaya to Aap ne is mein se piya jabke Aap ke daein ladka tha aur Aap ke baein budhe they, to Aap ne ladke se farmaya ke kya tum mujhe ijazat dete ho ke inhein dun. To ladke ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah, main aap se apne hisse par kisi ko tarjeeh na dunga. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apne haath mein de diya."
"1689","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas ko kehte suna ke Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne Saleem ki beti Umm Sulaim se kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kamzor aawaz suni hai jis mein bhook pehchanta hun, to kya tumhare paas koi cheez hai. To unhon ne kaha ke haan. To unhon ne jau ki tikiyan nikalin phir apna dupatta liya aur roti ko is ke baaz se lapeta phir use mere haath ke neeche dabaya aur mujhe is ke baaz se lauta diya phir mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas bheja. Unhon ne kaha ke main use lekar gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid mein baithe paya jabke Aap ke sath log they, to main un par khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhein Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne bheja hai. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke haan. Aap ne farmaya ke khane ke liye. To maine kaha ke haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo Aap ke sath they un se farmaya ke khade ho jao. Unhon ne kaha ke Aap chale aur main un ke aage chala yahan tak ke Talha ke bete Abu Talha ke paas aaya aur unhein khabar di to Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne kaha ke aye Saleem ki beti Umm Sulaim, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke sath aae hain jabke hamare paas khana nahi jo inhein khilayein. To unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ke Rasool zyada janne wale hain. Unhon ne kaha ke Talha ke bete Abu Talha chale yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mile aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Talha ke bete Abu Talha Aap ke sath aae yahan tak ke dakhil hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke lao aye Saleem ki beti Umm Sulaim jo tumhare paas hai. To wo wo roti lekar aaein to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is ka hukm diya aur wo todi gayi aur Saleem ki beti Umm Sulaim ne us par apni mashkiza nichodi aur use salan banaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo Allah ne chaha kehna tha kaha phir farmaya ke das ko dakhil hone ki ijazat do. To unhein ijazat di aur unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke ser ho gae phir nikle, phir farmaya ke das ko ijazat do. To unhein ijazat di aur unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke ser ho gae phir nikle, phir farmaya ke das ko ijazat do. To unhein ijazat di aur unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke ser ho gae phir nikle, phir farmaya ke das ko ijazat do. To unhein ijazat di aur unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke ser ho gae phir nikle, phir farmaya ke das ko ijazat do. Yahan tak ke tamam qoum ne khaya aur ser hui jabke qoum sattar ya assi mard thi."
"1690","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke do ka khana teen ko kafi hai aur teen ka khana chaar ko kafi hai."
"1691","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Zubair ke bete Abi Zubair se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke darwaza band karo aur mashkiza bandho aur bartan aundha karo ya bartan dhanpo aur chiragh bujhao kyunke shaitan band ko nahi kholta aur na bandhan kholta hai aur na bartan kholta hai, aur chuha logon par un ka ghar jala deti hai."
"1692","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maqbari Saeed ke bete Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Kabi Shuraij ke bete Abi Shuraij se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo bhalai kahe ya khamosh rahe, aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo apne padosi ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho wo apne mehmaan ki izzat kare, us ka inaam din raat hai aur us ki mezbani teen din hai, phir jo is ke baad ho wo sadqa hai, aur us ke liye halal nahi ke us ke paas thehre yahan tak ke use tang kare."
"1693","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke azad karda Suma se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jabke mard raaste mein chal raha tha to use sakht pyas lagi aur us ne kunwan paya aur is mein utra aur piya aur nikla to achanak kutta hanp raha tha jo pyas se mitti kha raha tha, to mard ne kaha ke is kutte ko pyas se wo pahunchi hai jo mujhe pahunchi thi, to kunwein mein utra aur apna moza bhara phir use apne munh se pakda yahan tak ke chadha aur kutte ko pilaya, to Allah ne us ka shukr ada kya aur use bakhsh diya. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya humare liye janwaron mein ajr hai. To Aap ne farmaya ke har tar kaleje wale mein ajr hai."
"1694","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Kaisan ke bete Wahb se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahil ki taraf lashkar bheja aur un par Jarrah ke bete Abi Ubaida ko ameer banaya jabke wo teen sau they. Unhon ne kaha ke main un mein tha. Unhon ne kaha ke hum nikle yahan tak ke jab raaste ke baaz hisse mein they to tosha khatm ho gaya to Ubaida ke bete Abu Ubaida ne us lashkar ke toshon ka hukm diya aur wo sab jama kya gaya to khajoor ka thaila tha. Unhon ne kaha ke wo hamein har din thoda thoda khilate they yahan tak ke khatm ho gaya aur hamein aik aik khajoor ke siwa na pahunchi, to maine kaha ke khajoor kya faida degi. To us ne kaha ke hum ne us ki kami pai jab wo khatm hui. Unhon ne kaha ke phir hum samandar tak pahunche to achanak teele jaisi machhli thi aur us lashkar ne is mein se atharah raatein khaya phir Ubaida ke bete Abu Ubaida ne us ki pasliyon mein se do pasliyon ka hukm diya aur wo khadi ki gain phir sawari ka hukm diya aur wo taiyar ki gayi phir in dono ke neeche se guzri aur inhein na chhua."
"1695","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Muaz ke bete Saad ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apni dadi se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aye momin auraton tum mein se koi apni padosan ko haqeer na jane agarche bakri ka jala hua khur ho."
"1696","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Yahud ko halaak kare, inhein charbi khane se mana kya gaya tha to unhon ne use becha aur us ki qeemat khai."
"1697","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Maryam ke bete Isa kehte they ke aye Bani Israil tum par meetha pani aur jangli sabzi aur jau ki roti lazim hai, aur gandum ki roti se bacho kyunke tum us ke shukr ko ada na karoge."
"1698","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil hue aur is mein Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr aur Umar bin Khattab ko paya aur in dono se pucha to un dono ne kaha ke hamein bhook ne nikala hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe bhi bhook ne nikala hai. To wo Taihan Ansari ke bete Abi Haitham ke paas gae to unhon ne un ke liye jau ka hukm diya jo us ke paas tha aur us ne kaam kya aur un ke liye bakri zibah karne khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke doodh wali se kinara karo. To un ke liye bakri zibah ki aur un ke liye meetha pani laya aur use khajoor mein latkaya phir wo khana laya gaya aur is mein se khaya aur us pani mein se piya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum se is din ki nemat ke bare mein zaroor pucha jaega."
"1699","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab roti ghee se khate they to dehat walon mein se mard ko bulaya aur wo khane laga aur luqme se thali ke kinare pochhne laga, to Umar ne kaha ke goya tum qehet zada ho. To us ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam maine ghee na khaya aur na is se khana dekha itne itne se. To Umar ne kaha ke main ghee na khaunga yahan tak ke log jeeyein jab se wo jeeyein."
"1700","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko dekha jabke wo us din Ameerul Momineen they, un ke liye khajoor ka aik sa dala jata tha aur wo use khate they yahan tak ke us ki ghatiya khate."
"1701","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab se tiddi ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne kaha ke maine chaha ke mere paas tokri ho jis mein se khayein."
"1702","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Halahla ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne Khaitham ke bete Malik ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Aqiq mein apni zameen mein Abu Huraira ke sath baitha tha to Madina walon mein se qoum un ke paas sawariyon par aayi aur un ke paas utri. Humaid ne kaha ke Abu Huraira ne kaha ke meri walida ke paas jao aur kaho ke tumhara beta tumhein salam kehta hai aur kehta hai ke hamein koi cheez khilao. Unhon ne kaha ke us ne thali mein teen tikiyan aur tel aur namak mein se kuchh rakha phir use apne sar par rakha aur in ke paas uthakar lai, phir jab use un ke samne rakha to Abu Huraira ne takbeer kahi aur kaha ke Allah ki hamd hai jis ne hamein roti se ser kya is ke baad ke hamara khana siyah do cheezon, pani aur khajoor ke siwa na tha. To qoum ne khane mein se kuchh na paya, phir jab wo munsarif hue to unhon ne kaha ke aye bhatije apni bakriyon se acha sulook karo aur in se naak ki rutoobat ponchho aur in ke baade ko umda karo aur is ke kinare mein namaz padho kyunke ye Jannat ke janwaron mein se hain, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai qareeb hai ke logon par zamana aae ke bakriyon ka garoh us ke malik ko Marwan ke ghar se zyada pasand hoga."
"1703","Mujhe Malik se, Nuaim ke bete Abi Nuaim Wahb se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khana laya gaya jabke Aap ke sath Salma ke bete Abi Salma ke bete Umar Aap ke parwarda they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke Allah ka naam lo aur jo tumhare pehlu mein ho khao."
"1704","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Muhammad ke bete Qasim ko kehte suna ke mard Abbas ke bete Abdullah ke paas aaya aur us se kaha ke mera yateem hai aur us ke oont hain to kya main us ke oonton ke doodh mein se piyun. To Abbas ke bete Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke agar tum us ke oonton ki gumi talash karte ho aur un ke kharish wale oonton ko tar ya gandhak lagate ho aur us ke hauz ko leepta ho aur use us ke ghaat ke din pilate ho to piyo baghair nasal ko nuqsan pahunchaye aur na dohne mein zyadati karte hue."
"1705","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo kabhi khana aur na sharbat laya jata tha yahan tak ke dawai, aur wo use khata ya pita magar kehta ke Allah ki hamd hai jis ne hamein hidayat di aur hamein khilaya aur pilaya aur hamein nemat di, Allah sab se bada hai, aye Allah hamein apni nemat se har shar se milade, hum ne is mein subah aur shaam ki har bhalai se, hum tum se is ke tamam aur shukr ka sawal karte hain, tumhari bhalai ke siwa koi bhalai nahi aur tumhare siwa koi mabood nahi, salehon ke mabood aur jahanon ke Rab, Allah ki hamd hai aur Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo Allah chahe aur Allah ke siwa koi quwwat nahi, aye Allah hamein jo tune diya us mein barkat de aur hamein aag ke azaab se bacha. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se pucha gaya ke kya aurat ghair mehram ke sath ya apne ghulam ke sath khae. To Malik ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi jab ye us taur par ho jo aurat ke liye maroof hai ke wo mardon mein se us ke sath khae. Unhon ne kaha ke aurat apne shohar ke sath aur ghair ke sath jo use khilata hai ya apne bhai ke sath is jaisa kha sakti hai, aur aurat ke liye makrooh hai ke mard se tanhai kare jis ke aur us ke darmiyan hurmat nahi."
"1706","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke gosht se bacho kyunke is ki aadat sharaab ki aadat jaisi hai."
"1707","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir ko paya jabke us ke sath gosht ka bojh tha, to kaha ke ye kya hai. To us ne kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen hum gosht ke mushtaq hue to maine dirham se gosht khareeda. To Umar ne kaha ke kya tum mein se aik chahta hai ke apna pet apne padosi ya chacha zad se lapete, tum se ye aayat kahan jati hai ke tum ne apni duniya ki zindagi mein apni pakeeza cheezein le lin aur is se faida uthaya."
"1708","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sone ki anguthi pehente they phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khade hue aur use phenk diya aur farmaya ke ise kabhi na pehnunga. Unhon ne kaha ke logon ne apni anguthiyan phenk din."
"1709","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sadaqa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab se anguthi pehenne ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke pehno aur logon ko khabar do ke maine tumhein is ka fatwa diya hai."
"1710","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Tamim ke bete Ubad se riwayat kya ke Ansari Abu Bashir ne unhein khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Aap ke baaz safaron mein they. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qasid bheja. Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha ke jabke log apne dopahar ke aaram mein they ke oont ki gardan mein taant ki qilaada ya qilaada baqi na rahe magar kaat di jae."
"1711","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hanif ke bete Sahl ke bete Umama ke bete Abi Umama Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne walid ko kehte suna ke mere walid Hanif ke bete Sahl ne Kharar mein ghusl kya aur jo jubba us par tha utara jabke Rabia ke bete Aamir dekh rahe they. Unhon ne kaha ke Sahl safed khubsurat jild wale mard they. Unhon ne kaha ke Rabia ke bete Aamir ne us se kaha ke maine aaj jaisa aur na kunwari ki jild dekhi. Unhon ne kaha ke Sahl usi jagah beemar hue aur un ki beemari sakht hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya gaya aur khabar di gayi ke Sahl beemar hain aur wo aap ke sath rawana na honge ya Rasulullah, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas aae aur Sahl ne Aap ko Aamir ke muamle ki khabar di jo tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kis par qatal karta hai, tum ne barkat ki dua kyun na ki, nazar haq hai, us ke liye wuzu karo. To Aamir ne us ke liye wuzu kya aur Sahl Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rawana hue jabke unhein koi takleef na thi."
"1712","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Hanif ke bete Sahl ke bete Umama ke bete Abi Umama se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rabia ke bete Aamir ne Hanif ke bete Sahl ko ghusl karte dekha aur kaha ke maine aaj jaisa aur na parde wali ki jild dekhi. To Sahl gir pade to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya gaya aur kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah kya aap Sahl ke bare mein karte hain, Allah ki qasam wo apna sar na uthate hain. To Aap ne farmaya ke kya tum us ke liye kisi par tohmat lagate ho. Unhon ne kaha ke hum Rabia ke bete Aamir par tohmat lagate hain. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aamir ko bulaya aur us par gussa kya aur farmaya ke tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kis par qatal karta hai, tum ne barkat ki dua kyun na ki, us ke liye ghusl karo. To Aamir ne apna chehra aur dono haath aur kohniyan aur ghutne aur dono paon ke kinare aur tehband ke andar pyale mein dhoe phir us par dala aur Sahl logon ke sath rawana hue jabke unhein koi takleef na thi."
"1713","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Qais ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Talib ke bete Abi Talib ke bete Jafar ke dono bete Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hue to Aap ne in dono ki parwarish karne wali se farmaya ke mujhe kya hai ke main inhein kamzor dekhta hun. To in dono ki parwarish karne wali ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah inhein nazar jaldi lagti hai aur hamein in dono ke liye dam karane se is ke siwa kuchh ne na roka ke hum nahi jante ke is mein se aap ko kya muwafiq hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke in dono ke liye dam karo kyunke agar koi cheez taqdeer se aage badhti to nazar aage badhti."
"1714","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Zubair ke bete Urwa ne unhein bayan kya ke Rasulullah."
"1715","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab banda beemar ho to Allah Taala us ki taraf do farishte bhejta hai aur kehta hai ke dekho wo apne ayadat karne walon se kya kehta hai. Phir agar wo jab us ke paas aaein Allah ki hamd kare aur us ki sana kare to wo dono use Allah Azza wa Jal ki taraf uthate hain, jabke wo zyada janne wala hai, to wo kehta hai ke mere bande ke liye hai ke agar main use wafat dun to use Jannat mein dakhil karun, aur agar main use shifa dun to us ke gosht se behtar gosht aur us ke khoon se behtar khoon badal dun aur us se us ki buraiyan mita dun."
"1716","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khasifa ke bete Yazeed se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin ko koi musibat na pahunchti hai yahan tak ke kaanta magar is se qasas liya jaega ya is se us ki khatayon mein se kaffara kya jaega. Yazeed nahi jante ke Urwa ne in dono mein se kaun kaha."
"1717","Mujhe Malik ne Abdullah ke bete Abi Sasa ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Yasar ke bete Abi Habab Saeed ko Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis se Allah bhalai chahta hai use musibat pahunchata hai."
"1718","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein mard ke paas maut aayi to mard ne kaha ke use mubarak ho, wo mara aur beemari se aazmaya na gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum par afsos, tumhein kya maloom, agar Allah use beemari se aazmata jo is se us ki buraiyon ka kaffara karti."
"1719","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khasifa ke bete Yazeed se riwayat kya ke Salmi Kaab ke bete Abdullah ke bete Amr ne unhein khabar di ke Jubair ke bete Nafi ne unhein Aas ke bete Abi Aas Usman se khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae. Usman ne kaha ke mujhe dard hai jo mujhe halaak karne ke qareeb tha. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use apne daein haath se saat martaba masaho aur kaho ke main Allah ki izzat aur qudrat se us ke shar se panah mangta hun jo pata hun. Unhon ne kaha ke maine ye kaha to Allah ne jo mujh mein tha jata kya aur main hamesha se apne ghar walon aur un ke ilawa ko is ka hukm deta hun."
"1720","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab beemar hote to apne upar muawwizat padh kar dam karte aur phoonkte. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab Aap ka dard sakht hua to main Aap par padhti thi aur Aap par Aap ke daein haath se masah karti thi us ki barkat ki umeed mein."
"1721","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr Aaisha ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo beemar thin aur Yahudi aurat un par dam kar rahi thi, to Abu Bakr ne kaha ke use Allah ki kitab se dam karo."
"1722","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein mard ko zakhm laga aur zakhm mein khoon jama ho gaya, aur mard ne Anmar ke Banu mein se do mardon ko bulaya aur unhon ne us ki taraf dekha aur unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne in dono se farmaya ke tum dono mein se kaun zyada tabib hai. To un dono ne kaha ke kya tib mein bhalai hai ya Rasulullah. To Zaid ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dawai utari jo beemariyan utarin."
"1723","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Zara ke bete Saad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein halaq ki sozish se daghe gae aur mar gae."
"1724","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar laqwa se daghe gae aur bichhu se dam kiye gae."
"1725","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Munzir ki beti Fatima se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr ki beti Asma jab un ke paas aurat laayi jati jo bukhar mein hoti to us ke liye dua kartin, pani letin aur use us ke aur us ke gireban ke darmiyan daltin aur kehtin ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein hukm karte they ke use pani se thanda karein."
"1726","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bukhar Jahannam ki bhaap se hai to use pani se thanda karo."
"1727","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bukhar Jahannam ki bhaap se hai to use pani se bujhao."
"1728","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Abdullah ke bete Jabir se khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab mard beemar ki ayadat kare wo rehmat mein dakhil hota hai yahan tak ke jab us ke paas baithe to is mein qaraar pata hai. Ya is jaisa."
"1729","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Ashaj ke bete Abdullah ke bete Bakir se, Atiya ke bete Ibn Atiya se khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke na chhoot aur na ullu aur na safar, aur beemar ko tandrust par halal nahi aur tandrust halal ho jahan chahe. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ye kya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye takleef hai."
"1730","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid Umar ke bete Ibn Umar ke azad karda Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muchhein katane aur dadhi badhane ka hukm diya."
"1731","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Sufyan ke bete Abi Sufyan Muawiya ko hajj ke saal suna jabke wo mimbar par they aur baalon ka jooda liya jo pehredar ke haath mein tha, kehte hain ke aye Madina walo tumhare ulema kahan hain, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is jaisa se mana karte suna hai aur kehte hain ke Bani Israil halaak huin jab un ki auraton ne ye apnaya."
"1732","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saad ke bete Ziyad se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni peshani latkayi jitna Allah ne chaha phir is ke baad maang nikali. Malik ne kaha ke mard par us ke bete ki biwi ke baalon ya us ki biwi ki maan ke baalon ki taraf dekhne mein koi harj nahi."
"1733","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo khassi karne ko makrooh samajhte they aur is mein kehte they ke takhleeq mukammal hai."
"1734","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saleem ke bete Safwan se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala us ke liye ya ghair ke liye Jannat mein in dono jaisa hun jab darae. Aur apni darmiyani ungli aur anguthe se mili hui se ishara kya."
"1735","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Ansari Abu Qatada ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke meri zulfein hain to kya main inhein kanghi karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan aur in ki izzat karo. To Abu Qatada kabhi din mein do martaba tel lagate they jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya tha ke in ki izzat karo."
"1736","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Yasar ke bete Ata ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein they to mard dakhil hua jabke us ke sar aur dadhi ke baal bikhre hue they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ki taraf apne haath se ishara kya ke niklo, goya us ke sar aur dadhi ke baalon ko durust karne ka irada karte they, to mard ne aisa kya phir lauta to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya ye behtar nahi ke tum mein se aik bikhre baalon ke sath aae goya shaitan hai."
"1737","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Taimi Ibrahim ke bete Muhammad ne, Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se khabar di ke Yaghuth ke bete Abd ke bete Aswad ke bete Abdur Rahman ne kaha jabke wo un ke humnasheen they aur wo safed dadhi aur sar wale they. Unhon ne kaha ke aik din subah un ke paas aae jabke in dono ko surkh kar chuke they. Unhon ne kaha ke qoum ne us se kaha ke ye behtar hai, to us ne kaha ke meri walida Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne guzri raat apni Nakhila londi ko bheja aur us ne qasam khai ke main zaroor rangunga, aur unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr rangte they. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko baalon ko siyah rangne ke bare mein kehte suna ke maine is mein koi maloom cheez na suni aur is ke ilawa rangna mujhe zyada pasand hai. Unhon ne kaha ke tamam rangna chhorna wasee hai insha Allah, logon par is mein tangi nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke is hadis mein bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne na ranga, aur agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rangte to Aaisha Yaghuth ke bete Abd ke bete Aswad ke bete Abdur Rahman ko is se khabar bhejti."
"1738","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Waleed ke bete Khalid ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke main apne khwab mein darta hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kaho ke main Allah ke mukammal kalimon se us ke gusse aur us ki saza aur us ke bandon ke shar aur shaitanon ke waswason aur un ke hazir hone se panah mangta hun."
"1739","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko asra karaya gaya aur unhon ne jinno mein se ifreet dekha jo Aap ko aag ke shoale se talab karta tha, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mutawajjeh hote use dekhte, to Jibreel ne Aap se kaha ke kya main tumhein kalime na sikhaun jo kaho jab kaho to us ka shoala bujh jae aur wo munh ke bal gire. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kyun nahi. To Jibreel ne kaha ke kaho ke main Allah Kareem ke chehre se aur Allah ke mukammal kalimon se jin se na neik aage badhta hai aur na badkar, us ke shar se jo aasman se utarta hai aur us ke shar se jo is mein chadhta hai aur us ke shar se jo zameen mein phailaya gaya hai aur us ke shar se jo is mein se nikalta hai, aur raat din ke fitnon se aur raat din ke aane walon se magar wo aane wala jo bhalai se aae, aye Rahman."
"1740","Mujhe Malik ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Aslam mein se mard ne kaha ke main is raat na soya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kis cheez se. To us ne kaha ke mujhe bichhu ne danga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raha tum, agar tum kehte jab shaam karte ke main Allah ke mukammal kalimon se us ke shar se panah mangta hun jo us ne paida kya. To tumhein nuqsan na pahunchata."
"1741","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke azad karda Suma se, unhon ne Hakeem ke bete Qaqa se riwayat kya ke Ahbar ke bete Kaab ne kaha ke agar wo kalime na hote jo kehta hun to Yahud mujhe gadha bana dete. To us se kaha gaya ke wo kya hain. To us ne kaha ke main Allah Azeem ke chehre se jis se koi cheez azeem nahi aur Allah ke mukammal kalimon se jin se na neik aage badhta hai aur na badkar aur Allah ke achhe naamon tamam se, jo in mein se jana aur jo na jana, us ke shar se jo us ne paida kya aur banaya aur phailaya, panah mangta hun."
"1742","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Mamar ke bete Abdullah ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Abi Habab Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala Qiyamat ke din kehta hai ke meri azmat ke liye aapas mein mohabbat karne wale kahan hain, aaj inhein apne saye mein saya dunga jis din mere saye ke siwa koi saya nahi."
"1743","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ansari Abdur Rahman ke bete Khubaib se, unhon ne Aasim ke bete Hafs se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se ya Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke saat jinhein Allah apne saye mein saya dega jis din us ke saye ke siwa koi saya nahi, adil imam aur jawan jo Allah ki ibadat mein pala badha."
"1744","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab Allah bande se mohabbat karta hai to Jibreel se kehta hai ke maine fulan se mohabbat ki hai to is se mohabbat karo. To Jibreel is se mohabbat karta hai phir aasman walon mein pukarta hai ke Allah ne fulan se mohabbat ki hai to is se mohabbat karo. To aasman wale is se mohabbat karte hain phir us ke liye zameen mein qubooliyat rakhi jati hai. Aur jab Allah bande se bughz rakhta hai. Malik ne kaha ke main nahi samajhta magar ke unhon ne bughz mein is jaisa kaha."
"1745","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abi Hazim se, unhon ne Khaulani Abu Idris se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Damishq ki masjid mein dakhil hua to chamakte danton wala jawan ladka tha jabke log us ke sath they, jab wo kisi cheez mein ikhtilaf karte to us ki taraf ruju karte aur us ke qaul se wapas aate, to maine us ke bare mein pucha to kaha gaya ke ye Jabal ke bete Muaz hain. Phir jab agla din tha to maine sawere ki aur use paya ke wo mujh se sawere mein aage badh chuka tha aur use namaz padhte paya. Unhon ne kaha ke maine us ka intezar kya yahan tak ke us ne apni namaz poori ki phir us ke paas us ke chehre ki taraf se aaya aur use salam kya phir kaha ke Allah ki qasam main tum se Allah ke liye mohabbat karta hun. To us ne kaha ke Allah. To maine kaha ke Allah. To us ne kaha ke Allah. To maine kaha ke Allah. To us ne kaha ke Allah. To maine kaha ke Allah. Unhon ne kaha ke us ne meri chadar ke kinare se pakda aur mujhe apne paas kheencha aur kaha ke khushkhabri pao kyunke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke meri mohabbat un ke liye wajib hui jo mere liye aapas mein mohabbat karte hain aur jo mere liye majlis karte hain aur jo mere liye milne aate hain aur jo mere liye kharch karte hain."
"1746","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Abbas ke bete Abdullah se khabar pahunchi hai ke wo kehte they ke miyana rawi aur tahammul aur achi waza nabuwwat ke pachees hisson mein se hissa hai."
"1747","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ansari Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke saleh mard ka acha khwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se hissa hai. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is jaisa riwayat kya."
"1748","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Adam aur Musa ne hujjat ki aur Adam Musa par ghalib aae. Musa ne us se kaha ke tum Adam ho jis ne logon ko gumrah kya aur inhein Jannat se nikala, to Adam ne us se kaha ke tum Musa ho jise Allah ne har cheez ka ilm diya aur use logon par apni risalat se muntakhab kya. Unhon ne kaha ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke kya tum mujhe us muamle par malamat karte ho jo mujh par muqaddar kya gaya tha is se pehle ke main paida kya jaun."
"1749","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Sasa ke bete Zafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab subah ki namaz se munsarif hote to kehte ke kya tum mein se kisi ne aaj raat khwab dekha. Aur kehte ke mere baad nabuwwat mein se ache khwab ke siwa kuchh baqi na rahega."
"1750","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere baad nabuwwat mein se mubashshirat ke siwa kuchh baqi na rahega. To unhon ne kaha ke mubashshirat kya hain ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke acha khwab jise saleh mard dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jae, nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se hissa hai."
"1751","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rabi ke bete Abu Qatada ko kehte suna ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke acha khwab Allah se hai aur bura khwab shaitan se hai, phir jab tum mein se koi wo cheez dekhe jo napasand kare to apne baein teen martaba thuthkare jab jaage aur Allah se us ke shar se panah mange kyunke wo use nuqsan na dega insha Allah. Abu Salma ne kaha ke main khwab dekhta tha jo mujh par pahad se zyada bhari hota tha, phir jab maine ye hadis suni to main is ki parwa na karta tha."
"1752","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo is aayat ke bare mein kehte they ke un ke liye duniya ki zindagi aur aakhirat mein khushkhabri hai. Unhon ne kaha ke ye acha khwab hai jise saleh mard dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jae."
"1753","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maisara ke bete Musa se, unhon ne Hind ke bete Abi Hind Saeed se, unhon ne Ashari ke bete Abi Musa se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo chaupad se khele us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"1754","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Alqama ke bete Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke un ke ghar mein ghar walon mein se jo is mein rehne wale they un ke paas chaupad thi, to unhon ne inhein bheja ke agar tum use na nikaloge to main tumhein apne ghar se nikalungi, aur is ka un par inkar kya."
"1755","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo jab apne ghar walon mein se kisi ko chaupad se khelte pate to use marte aur use tod dete. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke shatranj mein koi bhalai nahi. Aur use makrooh samjha aur unhein suna ke is se khelne ko aur batil mein se ghair se khelne ko makrooh samajhte aur ye aayat padhte ke haq ke baad gumrahi ke siwa kya hai."
"1756","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sawaar paidal ko salam kare aur jab qoum mein se aik salam kare to un se kafi ho."
"1757","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Kaisan ke bete Wahb se, unhon ne Ata ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Abbas ke bete Abdullah ke paas baitha tha to un ke paas Yaman walon mein se mard dakhil hua aur kaha ke assalam alaikum wa rahmatullah wa barakatuhu. Phir is ke sath kuchh zyada kya. Abbas ke bete Ibn Abbas ne kaha jabke wo us din beenai se mahroom ho chuke they ke ye kaun hai. Unhon ne kaha ke ye Yamani hai jo tumhare paas aata hai. To unhon ne use us se pehchanwaya. Unhon ne kaha ke Abbas ke bete Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke salam barkat tak khatm hota hai. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se pucha gaya ke kya aurat ko salam kya jae. To unhon ne kaha ke rahi budhi to main ise makrooh nahi samajhta, aur rahi jawan to main ise pasand nahi karta."
"1758","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Yahud jab tum mein se tumhein salam karein to wo to assam alaikum kehte hain. To kaho ke alaik."
"1759","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Aqeel ke bete Abi Talib ke azad karda Abu Murra se, unhon ne Laithi Abu Waqid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jabke Aap masjid mein baithe they aur log Aap ke sath they to achanak teen garoh aae aur do Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aae aur aik gaya, phir jab wo dono Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis par khade hue to salam kya, phir in dono mein se aik ne halqe mein khula dekha aur is mein baitha, aur dusra un ke peechhe baitha, aur teesra peeth pher kar gaya, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh hue to farmaya ke kya main tumhein teen garohon ke bare mein khabar na dun, raha in mein se aik to wo Allah ki taraf jhuka to Allah us ki taraf jhuka, aur dusra to us ne haya ki to Allah ne us se haya ki, aur dusra to us ne munh phera to Allah ne us se munh phera."
"1760","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ko suna jabke unhein mard ne salam kya aur unhon ne us par salam lautaya phir Umar ne mard se pucha ke tum kya ho. To us ne kaha ke main tumhare liye Allah ki hamd karta hun. To Umar ne kaha ke yehi wo hai jo maine tum se chaha tha."
"1761","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se riwayat kya ke Kaab ke bete Abi ke bete Tufail ne unhein khabar di ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aate they aur un ke sath subah bazaar jate they. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab hum subah bazaar jate to Abdullah bin Umar raddi aur bai wale aur miskeen aur kisi par se na guzarte magar use salam karte. Tufail ne kaha ke main aik din Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya aur unhon ne mujhe bazaar ki taraf apne peechhe lagaya to maine un se kaha ke tum bazaar mein kya karte ho jabke tum bai par na theherte ho aur na saman ke bare mein puchte ho aur na is se bhao karte ho aur na bazaar ki majlison mein baithete ho. Unhon ne kaha ke baitho humare sath yahan baat karein. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar ne mujh se kaha ke aye Abu Batn, jabke Tufail pet wale they, hum to salam ke liye subah jate hain, salam karte hain."
"1762","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Malik ke bete Abi Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ahbar ke bete Kaab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab tum pasand karo ke jano ke bande ka apne Rab ke paas kya hai to dekho ke us ke peechhe achi tareef mein se kya hai."
"1763","Mujhe Malik ne Saleem ke bete Safwan se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mard ne pucha aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya main apni walida se ijazat mangun. To Aap ne farmaya ke haan. Mard ne kaha ke main us ke sath ghar mein hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us se ijazat mango. To mard ne kaha ke main us ka khadim hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke us se ijazat mango, kya tum pasand karte ho ke use nangi dekho. Unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Aap ne farmaya ke us se ijazat mango."
"1764","Mujhe Malik ne apne nazdeek bharose wale shakhs se, unhon ne Ashaj ke bete Abdullah ke bete Bakir se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Busr se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Ashari ke bete Abi Musa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ijazat teen martaba hai, phir agar tumhein ijazat di jae to dakhil ho warna lauto."
"1765","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se, unhon ne apne ulema mein se ghair wahid se riwayat kya ke Ashari ke bete Abu Musa Umar bin Khattab ke paas ijazat mangne aae aur teen martaba ijazat mangi phir laute, to Umar bin Khattab ne us ke peechhe bheja aur kaha ke tumhein kya hua ke dakhil na hue. To Ashari ke bete Abu Musa ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke ijazat teen martaba hai, phir agar tumhein ijazat di jae to dakhil ho warna lauto. To Umar ne kaha ke ye kaun janta hai, agar tum mere paas use na lae jo ye janta hai to main tumhare sath aisa aisa karunga. To Ashari ke bete Abu Musa nikle yahan tak ke masjid mein majlis mein aae jise Ansar ki majlis kaha jata hai aur kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko khabar di hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke ijazat teen martaba hai, phir agar tumhein ijazat di jae to dakhil ho warna lauto. To us ne kaha ke agar tum mere paas use na lae jo ye janta hai to main tumhare sath aisa aisa karunga. To agar tum mein se kisi ne ye suna ho to mere sath khada ho. To unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se kaha ke us ke sath khade ho. Jabke Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed un mein sab se chhote they, to wo us ke sath khade hue aur is se Umar bin Khattab ko khabar di. To Umar bin Khattab ne Ashari ke bete Abu Musa se kaha ke raha main, maine tumhein jhoota na samjha lekin main dara ke log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jhoot bolein."
"1766","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar chheenke to use yarhamkallah kaho phir agar chheenke to use yarhamkallah kaho phir agar chheenke to use yarhamkallah kaho phir agar chheenke to kaho ke tum zukam zada ho. Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke teesri ke baad ya chauthi ke baad."
"1767","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab chheenkte aur un se kaha jata ke yarhamkallah. To kehte ke Allah hum par aur tum par rehem kare aur hamein aur tumhein bakhshe."
"1768","Mujhe Malik ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se riwayat kya ke Shifa ke azad karda Ishaq ke bete Rafi ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke main aur Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Abdullah Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed ke paas un ki ayadat karne dakhil hue to Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ne hum se kaha ke hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khabar di ke farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jismein mujassame ya tasweerein hon. Ishaq shak karte hain, nahi jante ke Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ne in dono mein se kaun kaha."
"1769","Mujhe Malik ne Nadr ke bete Abi Nadr se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se riwayat kya ke wo Ansari Talha ke bete Abi Talha ke paas un ki ayadat karne dakhil hue. Unhon ne kaha ke un ke paas Hanif ke bete Sahl ko paya to Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne insan ko bulaya aur us ke neeche se bistar kheench liya to Hanif ke bete Sahl ne us se kaha ke use kyun kheenchete ho. Unhon ne kaha ke is liye ke is mein tasweerein hain jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is mein jo kehna tha keh diya hai. To Sahl ne kaha ke kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne na farmaya magar jo kapde mein naqsh ho. Unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi lekin ye mere nafs ke liye umda hai."
"1770","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne takiya khareeda jis mein tasweerein thin, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use dekha to darwaze par khade hue aur dakhil na hue, to maine Aap ke chehre mein nakhushi pehchani aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah main Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf tauba karti hun, to maine kya gunah kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is takiye ka kya haal hai. Unhon ne kaha ke maine use aap ke liye khareeda hai taake aap is par baithein aur tek lagayein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke in tasweeron wale Qiyamat ke din azaab diye jaeinge, un se kaha jaega ke jo tum ne banaya use zinda karo. Phir farmaya ke jis ghar mein tasweerein hon farishte dakhil nahi hote."
"1771","Mujhe Malik ne Sasa ke bete Abi Sasa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Haris ki beti Maimuna ke ghar mein dakhil hue aur is mein safed saanp they jabke Aap ke sath Abbas ke bete Abdullah aur Waleed ke bete Khalid they, to Aap ne farmaya ke tumhare paas ye kahan se hain. To unhon ne kaha ke meri behan Haris ki beti Huzaila ne mujhe tohfe mein diye hain. To Aap ne Abbas ke bete Abdullah aur Waleed ke bete Khalid se farmaya ke khao. To un dono ne kaha ke kya aap na khaeinge ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne farmaya ke mere paas Allah ki taraf se hazir rehne wali hoti hai. Maimuna ne kaha ke kya main aap ko doodh pilaun jo hamare paas hai ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne farmaya ke haan. Phir jab piya to Aap ne farmaya ke tumhare paas ye kahan se hai. To unhon ne kaha ke meri behan Huzaila ne mujhe tohfe mein diya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne dekha ke tumhari londi jis mein tum ne mujh se azad karne ka mashwara manga tha, use apni behan ko do aur is se rishta jodo jo us ki dekhbhal kare kyunke ye tumhare liye behtar hai."
"1772","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Hanif ke bete Sahl ke bete Umama ke bete Abi Umama se, unhon ne Abbas ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Mughira ke bete Waleed ke bete Khalid se riwayat kya ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Maimuna ke ghar mein dakhil hue to bhuni hui goh laayi gayi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ki taraf apna haath badhaya. To baaz auraton ne jo Maimuna ke ghar mein thin kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar do jo Aap is mein se khana chahte hain. To kaha gaya ke ye goh hai ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne apna haath uthaya to maine kaha ke kya ye haram hai ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne farmaya ke nahi lekin ye meri qoum ki sarzameen mein na thi to main use napasand karta hun. Khalid ne kaha ke maine use kheench liya aur khaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dekh rahe they."
"1773","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pukara aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah aap goh mein kya kehte hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main na use khata hun aur na haram karta hun."
"1774","Mujhe Malik ne Khasifa ke bete Yazeed se riwayat kya ke Yazeed ke bete Saib ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Zuhair ke bete Abi Zuhair Sufyan ko suna jabke wo Azd Shanuah mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se mard hain aur wo masjid ke darwaze ke paas apne sath logon ko bayan kar rahe they, to unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke jo kutta rakhe jo us ke liye kheti aur na doodh ko faida de us ke amal mein se har din qeerat kam hoga. Unhon ne kaha ke kya tum ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. To us ne kaha ke haan, is masjid ke Rab ki qasam."
"1775","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo kutta rakhe magar shikari kutta ya maveshi ka kutta, us ke amal mein se har din do qeerat kam honge."
"1776","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kutton ko qatal karne ka hukm diya."
"1777","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kufr ka sar mashriq ki taraf hai aur fakhr aur takabbur ghode aur oont walon mein hai aur sakht dil oon walon mein hain aur sukoon bakriyon walon mein hai."
"1778","Mujhe Malik ne Sasa ke bete Abi Sasa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qareeb hai ke musalman ka behtar maal bakriyan hon jin ke peechhe wo pahadon ki chotiyon aur barish ki jagahon mein jae, apne deen se fitnon se bhage."
"1779","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi kisi ke maveshi ka doodh us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohe, kya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke us ke sharbat khane mein aaya jae aur us ka khazana toda jae aur us ka khana muntaqil kya jae, balke un ke liye un ke maweshiyon ke than un ke khane khazana karte hain, to koi kisi ke maveshi ka doodh magar us ki ijazat se na dohe."
"1780","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi Nabi nahi magar us ne bakriyan charayeen. Kaha gaya ke aur aap ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke aur main."
"1781","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Umar ke bete Ibn Umar ke paas us ka raat ka khana qareeb kya jata tha aur wo imam ki qirat sunte they jabke wo apne ghar mein hote, to apne khane se jaldi na karte yahan tak ke is mein se apni haajat poori karte."
"1782","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abbas ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Maimuna se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se chuhiya ke bare mein pucha gaya jo ghee mein gire. To Aap ne farmaya ke use aur jo us ke gird hai nikalo aur phenk do."
"1783","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abi Hazim se, unhon ne Saadi Sahl bin Saad se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ho to ghode aur aurat aur rehne mein. Yani nahusat."
"1784","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Abdullah ke beton Hamza aur Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahusat ghar aur aurat aur ghode mein hai."
"1785","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ghar jismein rehti thi jabke tadaad zyada thi aur maal wafir tha, to tadaad kam ho gayi aur maal jata raha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use mazmoom chhoro."
"1786","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah ne doodh wali oontni ke liye farmaya ke ise kaun dohega. To mard khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai. To mard ne us se kaha ke Murra. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke baitho. Phir farmaya ke ise kaun dohega. To mard khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai. To us ne kaha ke Harb. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke baitho. Phir farmaya ke ise kaun dohega. To mard khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai. To us ne kaha ke Yaeesh. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke doho."
"1787","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne mard se kaha ke tumhara naam kya hai. To us ne kaha ke Jamra. To unhon ne kaha ke kis ke bete. To us ne kaha ke Shihab ke bete. Unhon ne kaha ke kin mein se. Unhon ne kaha ke Hurqa mein se. Unhon ne kaha ke tumhara rehne kahan hai. Unhon ne kaha ke Harra-tun-Naar mein. Unhon ne kaha ke kin mein. Unhon ne kaha ke Zat-e-Laza mein. To Umar ne kaha ke apne ghar walon ko pao, wo jal gae hain. Unhon ne kaha ke hua jaisa Umar bin Khattab ne kaha."
"1788","Mujhe Malik ne Humaid Taweel se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne singhi lagwai, Aap ko Taiba ke bete Abu Taiba ne singhi lagai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ke liye khajoor ke aik sa ka hukm diya aur us ke ghar walon ko hukm diya ke us se us ka khiraj halka karein."
"1789","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar dawai beemari tak pahunchti hai to singhi us tak pahunchti hai."
"1790","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Harisa ke Banu mein se Mahisa ke bete Ibn Mahisa Ansari se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se singhi lagane wale ki ujrat mein ijazat mangi to Aap ne use is se mana kya, phir wo Aap se puchte rahe aur ijazat mangte rahe yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya ke use apne pani lane wale oont ko khilao. Yani tumhare ghulam ko."
"1791","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mashriq ki taraf ishara karte dekha aur kehte hain ke khabardar fitna yahan hai, fitna yahan hai, jahan se shaitan ka seengh tulu hota hai."
"1792","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Umar bin Khattab ne Iraq ki taraf nikalne ka irada kya to Ahbar ke bete Kaab ne us se kaha ke is ki taraf na niklo aye Ameerul Momineen kyunke is mein jadu ke das mein se nau hain aur is mein jinno ke fasiq hain aur is mein la-ilaj beemari hai."
"1793","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Lubaba ke bete Abi Lubaba se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghar walon saanpon ko qatal karne se mana kya."
"1794","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Aaisha ki saiba se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghar walon saanpon ko qatal karne se mana kya magar do dhariyon wale aur dum kate, kyunke ye dono beenai uchak lete hain aur auraton ke peton mein jo hai gira dete hain."
"1795","Mujhe Malik ne Aflah ke bete Ibn Aflah ke azad karda Saifi se, unhon ne Zuhra ke bete Hisham ke azad karda Saib ke bete Abi Saib se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed ke paas dakhil hua aur use namaz padhte paya to baitha us ka intezar karne laga yahan tak ke us ne apni namaz poori ki, to maine us ke ghar mein charpai ke neeche harkat suni to achanak saanp tha, to main use qatal karne khada hua to Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ne ishara kya ke baitho, phir jab wo munsarif hua to ghar mein ghar ki taraf ishara kya aur kaha ke kya tum ye ghar dekhte ho. To maine kaha ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke is mein naya byaha dulha tha jo shaadi ke qareeb tha, to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Khandaq ki taraf nikla, phir jabke wo is mein tha to us ke paas jawan aaya jo us se ijazat mangta tha aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujhe ijazat dein ke apne ghar walon se naya ahad karun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use ijazat di aur farmaya ke apne hathyar apne upar lo kyunke main tum par Quraiza ke Banu se darta hun. To jawan apne ghar walon ki taraf rawana hua aur apni biwi ko dono darwazon ke darmiyan khada paya to us ki taraf neze se jhuka taake use chubhoe aur use ghairat ne pa liya, to us ne kaha ke jaldi na karo yahan tak ke dakhil ho aur dekho jo tumhare ghar mein hai. To wo dakhil hua aur achanak saanp tha jo us ke bistar par lipta hua tha, to us ne is mein apna neza gaad diya phir use lekar nikla aur use ghar mein nasb kya, to saanp neze ke sar par tadpa aur jawan mar kar gir pada, to maloom na hua ke in dono mein se kaun jaldi mara, jawan ya saanp, to is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke Madina mein jinn hain jo musalman ho gae hain, phir jab un mein se koi cheez dekho to use teen din mohlat do, phir agar tumhein is ke baad zahir ho to use qatal karo kyunke ye to shaitan hai."
"1796","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab رکاب mein apna paon rakhte jab safar ka irada karte to kehte ke Allah ke naam se. Aye Allah tu safar mein sathi hai aur ghar walon mein khalifa hai, aye Allah humare liye zameen lapet de aur hum par safar aasan kar, aye Allah main tujh se safar ki mashaqqat aur lautne ki ranj aur maal aur ghar walon mein bure manzar se panah mangta hun."
"1797","Mujhe Malik ne apne nazdeek bharose wale shakhs se, unhon ne Ashaj ke bete Abdullah ke bete Yaqoob se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Busr se, unhon ne Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas Saad se, unhon ne Hakeem ki beti Khaula se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo thikane utre wo kahe ke main Allah ke mukammal kalimon se us ke shar se panah mangta hun jo us ne paida kya. To use koi cheez nuqsan na dega yahan tak ke kooch kare."
"1798","Mujhe Malik ne Harmala ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Shoaib ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sawaar shaitan hai aur do sawaar do shaitan hain aur teen sawaron ki jamaat hai."
"1799","Mujhe Malik ne Harmala ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan aik aur do ka irada karta hai, phir jab teen hon to un ka irada nahi karta."
"1800","Mujhe Malik ne Maqbari Saeed ke bete Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhne wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke din raat ki musafat safar kare magar apne mehram ke sath."
"1801","Mujhe Malik ne Sulaiman ke bete Abdul Malik ke azad karda Ubaid ke bete Abi Ubaid se, unhon ne Madan ke bete Khalid se riwayat kya jo uthate hain ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala narm hai, narmi ko pasand karta hai aur is se razi hota hai aur is par madad karta hai jo sakhti par madad nahi karta, phir jab tum in gungi sawariyon par sawaar ho to inhein un ke thikanon par utaro, phir agar zameen khushk ho to in se in ki charbi se najaat pao, aur tum par raat ka chalna lazim hai kyunke zameen raat mein lapeti jati hai jo din mein nahi lapeti jati, aur raaste par utarne se bacho kyunke ye janwaron ke raaste aur saanpon ki panahgah hain."
"1802","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Bakr ke azad karda Suma se, unhon ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke safar azaab ka tukda hai jo tum mein se aik ki neend aur khana aur sharbat rokta hai, phir jab tum mein se aik apne chehre se apni haajat poori kare to apne ghar walon ki taraf jaldi aae."
"1803","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Abu Huraira ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur kapda maroof se hai aur use kaam mein se magar jo taqat rakhe takleef na di jae."
"1804","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Umar bin Khattab Awali ki taraf har Hafta jate they, phir jab ghulam ko aise kaam mein pate jo wo taqat na rakhta tha to is se kam karte."
"1805","Mujhe Malik ne apne chacha Malik ke bete Abi Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Affan ke bete Usman ko khutba dete suna jabke wo kehte they ke londi ko ghair hunar wali kamai ki takleef na do kyunke jab tum use is ki takleef doge to wo apni sharmgah se kamaegi, aur bache ko kamai ki takleef na do kyunke jab wo na pae to chori karega, aur muaf karo jab Allah ne tumhein muaf kya, aur tum par khano mein se jo umda hon."
"1806","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghulam jab apne aaqa ki khairkhwahi kare aur Allah ki ibadat achi kare to us ke liye do martaba ajr hai."
"1807","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Khattab ke bete Umar ke bete Abdullah ki londi thi jise Umar bin Khattab ne dekha jabke wo azaad auraton ki haibat se taiyar hui thi, to apni beti Hafsa ke paas dakhil hue aur kaha ke kya maine tumhare bhai ki londi ko na dekha jo logon mein phirti hai jabke wo azaad auraton ki haibat se taiyar hui hai, aur Umar ne is ka inkar kya."
"1808","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke hum jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sunne aur itaat par baiat karte to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hum se kehte ke jitni taqat rakho."
"1809","Mujhe Malik ne Munkadar ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne Ruqaiqa ki beti Umaima se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas auraton mein aayi jo Aap se Islam par baiat kartin, to unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hum aap se baiat kartin hain ke Allah ke sath koi cheez shareek na karein aur na chori karein aur na zina karein aur na apne bachon ko qatal karein aur na bohtan laein jo hum apne haathon aur paon ke darmiyan ghadein aur maroof mein aap ki nafarmani na karein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jitni taqat rakho aur himmat rakho. Unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ke Rasool hum se hum se zyada rehem karne wale hain, aaein hum aap se baiat karte hain ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main auraton se musafaha nahi karta, sau auraton se mera qaul aik aurat se mere qaul jaisa hai ya aik aurat se mere qaul ke misaal."
"1810","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne Malik ke bete Abdul Marwan ko baiat karte hue likha aur us ki taraf likha ke Bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Rahim. Amma baad, Allah ke bande Malik ke bete Abdul Ameerul Momineen, tum par salam, main tumhare liye Allah ki hamd karta hun jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur tumhare liye sunne aur itaat ka iqrar karta hun Allah ki sunnat aur us ke Rasool ki sunnat par jitni taqat rakhun."
"1811","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo apne bhai se kahe ke aye kafir. To in dono mein se aik se lauti hai."
"1812","Mujhe Malik ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab mard ko suno jo kehta hai ke log halaak ho gae. To wo un mein sab se halaak hai."
"1813","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi na kahe ke aye zamane ki kharabi. Kyunke Allah hi zamana hai."
"1814","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Maryam ke bete Isa khinzeer se raaste mein mile aur us se kaha ke salamati se guzar. To us se kaha gaya ke tum ye khinzeer se kehte ho. To Maryam ke bete Isa ne kaha ke main darta hun ke apni zabaan ko buri baat se aadi karun."
"1815","Mujhe Malik ne Alqama ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Muzni Haris ke bete Bilal se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mard Allah ki raza ki baat kehta hai aur wo na samajhta tha ke wo jahan pahunchi pahunchi, Allah us ke liye is se apni raza us din tak likhta hai jis din is se milega, aur mard Allah ke gusse ki baat kehta hai aur wo na samajhta tha ke wo jahan pahunchi pahunchi, Allah us ke liye is se apna gussa us din tak likhta hai jis din is se milega."
"1816","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Abu Huraira ne kaha ke mard baat kehta hai jis ki use parwa nahi hoti aur is se Jahannam ki aag mein girta hai, aur mard baat kehta hai jis ki use parwa nahi hoti aur Allah us se use Jannat mein buland karta hai."
"1817","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mashriq se do mard aae aur khutba diya to log un ki fasahat par taajjub karne lage, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bayan mein jadu hai. Ya kaha ke baaz bayan mein jadu hai."
"1818","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Maryam ke bete Isa kehte they ke Allah ke zikr ke baghair baat zyada na karo aur tumhare dil sakht ho jaeinge kyunke sakht dil Allah se door hai lekin tum nahi jante, aur logon ke gunahon mein na dekho goya tum Rab ho, aur apne gunahon mein dekho goya tum bande ho, log to aazmaye hue aur aafiyat wale hain, to aazmaish walon par rehem karo aur Allah ki aafiyat par hamd karo."
"1819","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha apne baaz ghar walon ko isha ke baad bhejti thin aur kehtin ke kya tum katibon ko aaram nahi dete."
"1820","Mujhe Malik ne Sayyad ke bete Abdullah ke bete Waleed se riwayat kya ke Hantab Makhzumi ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muttalib ne unhein khabar di ke mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pucha ke gheebat kya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mard ka wo zikr karo jo wo sunna napasand kare. Unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah agarche haq ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum batil kaho to ye bohtan hai."
"1821","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jise Allah do ke shar se bachae wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. To mard ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hamein khabar na dein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahe, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) laute aur apne pehle qaul jaisa farmaya, to mard ne us se kaha ke hamein khabar na dein ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahe, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is jaisa bhi farmaya, to mard ne kaha ke hamein khabar na dein ya Rasulullah. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is jaisa bhi farmaya. Phir mard apne pehle qaul jaisa kehne gaya to us ke pehlu wala mard use khamosh karne laga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jise Allah do ke shar se bachae wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga, jo us ki dono dadhi ke darmiyan hai aur jo us ke dono paon ke darmiyan hai, jo us ki dono dadhi ke darmiyan hai aur jo us ke dono paon ke darmiyan hai, jo us ki dono dadhi ke darmiyan hai aur jo us ke dono paon ke darmiyan hai."
"1822","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo apni zabaan kheench rahe they, to Umar ne us se kaha ke thahro, Allah tumhein bakhshe. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke ye mujhe halakat ki jagahon mein le gayi hai."
"1823","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main aur Abdullah bin Umar Uqba ke bete Khalid ke ghar ke paas they jo bazaar mein hai, to mard aaya jo us se sargoshi karna chahta tha jabke Abdullah bin Umar ke sath mere aur us mard ke siwa jo us se sargoshi karna chahta tha koi na tha, to Abdullah bin Umar ne dusre mard ko bulaya yahan tak ke hum chaar ho gae, to mujh se aur us mard se kaha jise bulaya tha ke thoda peechhe hato kyunke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke do aik ke baghair sargoshi na karein."
"1824","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab teen hon to do aik ke baghair sargoshi na karein."
"1825","Mujhe Malik ne Saleem ke bete Safwan se riwayat kya ke mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke kya main apni biwi se jhoot bolun ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jhoot mein koi bhalai nahi. To mard ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah main is se wada karun aur us se kahun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum par koi gunah nahi."
"1826","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud kehte they ke tum par sach lazim hai kyunke sach neki ki taraf hidayat karta hai aur neki Jannat ki taraf hidayat karti hai, aur jhoot se bacho kyunke jhoot burai ki taraf hidayat karta hai aur burai aag ki taraf hidayat karti hai, kya tum nahi dekhte ke kaha jata hai ke sach bola aur neik hua aur jhoot bola aur bura hua."
"1827","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Luqman se kaha gaya ke tumhein wo kahan pahunchaya jo hum dekhte hain, fazl ka irada karte hue. To Luqman ne kaha ke baat ka sach aur amanat ki adayegi aur jo matlab nahi use chhorna."
"1828","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud kehte they ke banda hamesha jhoot bolta hai aur us ke dil mein siyah dag lagta hai yahan tak ke us ka tamam dil siyah ho jata hai aur wo Allah ke paas jhooton mein likha jata hai."
"1829","Mujhe Malik ne Saleem ke bete Safwan se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke kya momin buzdil hoga. To Aap ne farmaya ke haan. To us se kaha gaya ke kya momin bakheel hoga. To Aap ne farmaya ke haan. To us se kaha gaya ke kya momin jhoota hoga. To Aap ne farmaya ke nahi."
"1830","Mujhe Malik ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah tumhare liye teen se razi hota hai aur tumhare liye teen se naraz hota hai, tumhare liye razi hota hai ke us ki ibadat karo aur us ke sath koi cheez shareek na karo, aur ke tum sab Allah ki rassi ko mazboot pakdo, aur ke jis ko Allah ne tumhara muamla wali kya us ki khairkhwahi karo, aur tumhare liye qeel wa qaal aur maal zae karne aur zyada mangne se naraz hota hai."
"1831","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke logon mein badtareen do chehron wala hai jo in ke paas aik chehre se aata hai aur in ke paas chehre se."
"1832","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya hum halaak honge jabke hum mein saleh hon. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan jab khabaasat zyada ho jae."
"1833","Mujhe Malik ne Hakeem ke bete Abi Hakeem Ismail se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko kehte suna ke kaha jata tha ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala aam ko khas ke gunah se azaab nahi deta lekin jab munkar khullam khulla kya jae to sab saza ke haqdar hote hain."
"1834","Mujhe Malik ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko suna jabke main us ke sath nikla yahan tak ke deewar mein dakhil hue aur maine use kehte suna jabke mere aur us ke darmiyan deewar thi, jabke wo deewar ke andar tha, ke Umar bin Khattab Ameerul Momineen wah wah, Allah ki qasam tum Allah se zarur daroge ya wo tumhein zaroor azaab dega."
"1835","Malik ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Muhammad ke bete Qasim kehte they ke maine logon ko paya aur wo qaul se khush na hote they. Malik ne kaha ke un ka irada is se amal hai, balke us ke amal ko dekha jata hai aur us ke qaul ko nahi dekha jata."
"1836","Mujhe Malik ne Zubair ke bete Abdullah ke bete Aamir se riwayat kya ke wo jab garaj sunte to baat chhor dete."
"1837","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Nabi ke biwiyon ne jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mar gae irada kya ke Affan ke bete Usman ko Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke paas bhejein aur un se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni wirasat mangein, to Aaisha ne un se kaha ke kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne na farmaya ke hum waris nahi banate, jo hum ne chhora wo sadqa hai."
